Abstract

The current technological trend indicates a convergence of augmented reality (AR) with heads-up display (HUD) in car navigation UI's. In support of this trend, we propose use of small devices which have accelerometers or accelerometer-equipped smartphone as a basis of HUD interaction. In this paper, we defined the limited operation, experimented the basic operation and evaluated them. Then we obtained the good results. © 2014 IEEE.

